"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/3a1b6ca31ee500d3f791042ef9372591.webp?t=1769973608\" width=512 height=25 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find out why</strong> Peach is making you play his twisted game each night. Delve into the mystery thriller of The Color Fun Coloring Show and why it came to be.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/0c480748aab7ae8c33596316394d916b.poster.avif?t=1769973608\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/0c480748aab7ae8c33596316394d916b.webm?t=1769973608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/7136b35085a478c51295b81bfa0f289e.webp?t=1769973608\" width=512 height=25 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Night Shop:</strong>\u00a0Use the Night Shop at the end of each night to purchase upgrades or abilities to use against the color fun coloring show!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades that can be purchased in the Night Shop:</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Toy Robot to help you find the location of the intruder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Hitman to take out your least favored of the cast members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for Flashlight and movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip a Night Card</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/ab4007317a4021d28dfe0465c453f0d1.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/59b5896ffee7a7e3e9d20ca0cdd51cba.poster.avif?t=1769973608\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/59b5896ffee7a7e3e9d20ca0cdd51cba.webm?t=1769973608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/ab4007317a4021d28dfe0465c453f0d1.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/7e245dd84a0c3246b75f70d762cbdca5.webp?t=1769973608\" width=512 height=25 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Fear.</strong> Intruders not only can come in at random times but can also hide and wait in the places where they know you will be going to. Each intruder has different abilities and ways they will scare you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a Horror game unlike any other.</strong> Explore the deepest fears that come from The Color Fun Coloring Show.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/02caa1d0a133c1ddad40f414a764c3fd.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/2a0bbb44b49500268fa0040bab5382f0.poster.avif?t=1769973608\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/2a0bbb44b49500268fa0040bab5382f0.webm?t=1769973608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/02caa1d0a133c1ddad40f414a764c3fd.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/d309484f25f675bee92ce6fa118d4b1c.webp?t=1769973608\" width=512 height=25 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing the channel</strong> will change the show and each show will affect your game and outcome in different and extreme ways, so make sure to pick your favorite show! Get the Remote from the Night Shop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/81354e4b1fac38bda4532554f55a548b.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/e2a629e695ba7340af44b9215f7cc6af.poster.avif?t=1769973608\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/e2a629e695ba7340af44b9215f7cc6af.webm?t=1769973608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/81354e4b1fac38bda4532554f55a548b.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/c5c6e0421b7bf8b2e9c97640deda39e2.webp?t=1769973608\" width=512 height=25 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each night, you'll play Peaches</strong> twisted game to survive. You must follow Peaches instructions inside the house, find a specific color, and show it to Peach on the TV. But during the night. There will be intruders in the house who will hunt you down Get the color right and you'll live, Get it wrong and you're out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intruders</strong>\u00a0have different abilities from taking you to a basement every 30 seconds for 10 seconds to turning off any light in a room they are in to making you not move.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playthrough Time</strong> 2 to 4hrs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> depending on what you do and how you respond to your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p