 and each show will affect your game and outcome in different and extreme ways, so make sure to pick your favorite show! Get the Remote from the Night Shop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/81354e4b1fac38bda4532554f55a548b.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/e2a629e695ba7340af44b9215f7cc6af.poster.avif?t=1769973608\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/e2a629e695ba7340af44b9215f7cc6af.webm?t=1769973608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/81354e4b1fac38bda4532554f55a548b.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/c5c6e0421b7bf8b2e9c97640deda39e2.webp?t=1769973608\" width=512 height=25 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each night, you'll play Peaches</strong> twisted game to survive. You must follow Peaches instructions inside the house, find a specific color, and show it to Peach on the TV. But during the night. There will be intruders in the house who will hunt you down Get the color right and you'll live, Get it wrong and you're out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intruders</strong>\u00a0have different abilities from taking you to a basement every 30 seconds for 10 seconds to turning off any light in a room they are in to making you not move.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playthrough Time</strong> 2 to 4hrs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> depending on what you do and how you respond to your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay-ability</strong>\u00a0each time you play it will feel scary, with a good amount of randomization to keep every playthrough and level as fresh and scary as possible from random room spawns, intruders, buildings, tv locations and level sequences.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/c07195968062b1267210b5b519c0c73c.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/eaa52c994a68c81d0e6b5a0b858e3832.poster.avif?t=1769973608\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/eaa52c994a68c81d0e6b5a0b858e3832.webm?t=1769973608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/c07195968062b1267210b5b519c0c73c.webp?t=1769973608\" width=737 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/extras/480309d636cb8588f924609aada6fb94.webp?t=1769973608\" width=512 height=25 /></span></p>","developers":["West View"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831170/a7ae4361b0e4db86ffe6f875e251681b7871f019/header.jpg?t=1769973608","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2831170/1405632931/079c5f5b07040604d5b946f80d7a64dd353bfe7e/1761687287/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761692060","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2831170/1405632931/079c5f5b07040604d5b946f80d7a64dd353bfe7e/1761687287/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761692060","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2831170/1405632931/079c5f5b07040604d5b946f80d7a64dd353bfe7e/1761687287/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761692060","id":257077974,"name":"Color Fear Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257077974/5d51bf2090db30cf01eaca7c30f70819f6754559/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761692060"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2831170/581865849/17ffac9cc5ae59e25de798636bfda48b545be6b7/1750884481/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761692063","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2831170/581865849/17ffac9cc5ae59e25de798636bfda48b545be6b7/1750884481/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761692063","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2831170/581865849/17ffac9cc5ae59e25de798636bfda48b545be6b7/1750884481/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761692063","id":257161498,"name":"Color Fear Trailer 2 (The House)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161498/32483863b1ec701afb9f5f068dcfd78ed0b4f9a1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761692063"},{"dash_av1":"https